 "kb:hist:gdnw5:1": {
  "title": "水沸点",
  "aliases": [],
  "category": "自动",
  "facts": [
   {
    "label": "相关数据",
    "value": "加热到290℃时开始释放出三氧化硫，最终 变成为98.54%的水溶液， 在317℃时沸腾而成为共沸混 合物",
    "rating": "high",
    "source": {
     "name": "地方政府部门",
     "url": "http://zjjcmspublic.oss-cn-hangzhou-zwynet-d01-a.internet.cloud.zj.gov.cn/jcms_files/jcms1/web3249/site/picture/old/P020181128408310500906.pdf",
     "official_tag": true,
     "official_score": 0.9
    },
    "verified_at": "2026-09-11",
    "confidence": "高"
   },
   {
    "label": "相关数据",
    "value": "浓硝酸含量为68%左右，易挥发，在空气中产生 白雾（与浓盐酸相同），是硝酸蒸汽（一般来说是浓硝 酸分解出来的二氧化氮） 与水蒸汽结合而形成的硝酸小 液滴",
    "rating": "high",
    "source": {
     "name": "地方政府部门",
     "url": "http://zjjcmspublic.oss-cn-hangzhou-zwynet-d01-a.internet.cloud.zj.gov.cn/jcms_files/jcms1/web3249/site/picture/old/P020181128408310500906.pdf",
     "official_tag": true,
     "official_score": 0.9
    },
    "verified_at": "2026-09-11",
    "confidence": "高"
   },
   {
    "label": "相关数据",
    "value": "相对密度(d204)1.41， 熔点-42℃ （无水） ]， 沸点120.5℃ （68%）",
    "rating": "high",
    "source": {
     "name": "地方政府部门",
     "url": "http://zjjcmspublic.oss-cn-hangzhou-zwynet-d01-a.internet.cloud.zj.gov.cn/jcms_files/jcms1/web3249/site/picture/old/P020181128408310500906.pdf",
     "official_tag": true,
     "official_score": 0.9
    },
    "verified_at": "2026-09-11",
    "confidence": "高"
   },
   {
    "label": "相关数据",
    "value": "可加入0.6%～1%的乙醇作稳定剂",
    "rating": "high",
    "source": {
     "name": "地方政府部门",
     "url": "http://zjjcmspublic.oss-cn-hangzhou-zwynet-d01-a.internet.cloud.zj.gov.cn/jcms_files/jcms1/web3249/site/picture/old/P020181128408310500906.pdf",
     "official_tag": true,
     "official_score": 0.9
    },
    "verified_at": "2026-09-11",
    "confidence": "高"
   },
   {
    "label": "相关数据",
    "value": "蒸气能与空气形成爆炸性混合物， 爆炸极限1.2%～ 7.0% （体积）",
    "rating": "high",
    "source": {
     "name": "地方政府部门",
     "url": "http://zjjcmspublic.oss-cn-hangzhou-zwynet-d01-a.internet.cloud.zj.gov.cn/jcms_files/jcms1/web3249/site/picture/old/P020181128408310500906.pdf",
     "official_tag": true,
     "official_score": 0.9
    },
    "verified_at": "2026-09-11",
    "confidence": "高"
   },
   {
    "label": "相关数据",
    "value": "在一个标准大气压下水的沸点是100 摄氏度，压力越高,与之对应 压力下的沸点越高，这里是高压蒸汽锅,说明压力肯定大于一个标准大 气压(通常情况下的地表面的大气压强就认为是一个标准大气压)，也就 是说高压蒸汽锅肯定要超过100 摄氏度才能沸腾，才能产生蒸汽",
    "rating": "high",
    "source": {
     "name": "高校/教育机构",
